  SDD_SEQ_02_Auth->>SDD_SEQ_02_Auth: verify password and exactly one role
  alt Organization Administrator requires MFA
  SDD_SEQ_02_Auth-->>SDD_SEQ_02_UI: enrollment/challenge stage
  SDD_SEQ_02_User->>SDD_SEQ_02_UI: valid authenticator proof
  SDD_SEQ_02_UI->>SDD_SEQ_02_API: verify proof
  SDD_SEQ_02_API->>SDD_SEQ_02_Auth: verifyTotp(...)
  SDD_SEQ_02_Auth->>SDD_SEQ_02_DB: replay-safe accepted TOTP step
  else other eligible single role
  SDD_SEQ_02_Auth-->>SDD_SEQ_02_API: full principal
  end
  SDD_SEQ_02_API-->>SDD_SEQ_02_UI: server session / safe identity
  SDD_SEQ_02_User->>SDD_SEQ_02_UI: protected action
  SDD_SEQ_02_UI->>SDD_SEQ_02_Guard: authenticated request
  SDD_SEQ_02_Guard->>SDD_SEQ_02_DB: recheck membership and paid access
  SDD_SEQ_02_Guard->>SDD_SEQ_02_Guard: verify resource organization/assignment
